This program is OpenStage Hub's code with Prism's brand file, app list and documents; both are by the same author.

Code adapted from the author's OpenStage projects, also Apache 2.0:
- The version ordering (alpha, beta, rc, final) and the WinHTTP request code follow OpenExplainer's src-tauri/src/updates.rs.
- tools/sign_windows.py is the suite's shared signing script, copied from OpenExplainer.
- tools/make-icons.mjs draws the icon in headless Microsoft Edge the same way as OpenStage Author's tools/svg_to_png.mjs.
- The PrismOpenResearch icon (brand/PrismOpenResearch.svg) was supplied by Jason S. Wrench on 2026-11-15.

